# Save tokens (LiveBid)

- Answer in few short sentences unless the user asks for detail.
- One task per turn. Do not expand scope or re-run verify/e2e/staging unless asked.
- Prefer grep/read of specific files over broad exploration or subagents.
- Skip long summaries of prior work; no restating LAUNCH/PUBLISH unless the user says publish/launch/deploy.
- Do not start parallel research when a direct fix or yes/no is enough.
